        dcterms:description "Vendors and SHA-256-verifies the CC BY 4.0 Boehm et al. (2010) Fig. 2 mouse limb bud specimen `datasets/limb_bud_elongation_pushing/mouse_limb_bud_specimen.jpg`, performs automated contour segmentation across 5 sub-panels (`segment_limb_bud_specimen`, L577-673) — extracting Panel F dorsal St1/St0 PD ratio = 1.3404, Panel F posterior St1/St0 PD ratio = 1.3587 (AR 1.0888 -> 1.3021), Panel D/E 3D OPT iso-surface AR gain = 1.1732, and Panel G FEM cyan mesh fraction = 0.3694 — and matches the 5-regime empirical hierarchy (r = 0.9970)." ;
